  "solution": "Given Equation: 78 * 26 * 4 * 13 * 28 = 58\n\nWe check the each option.\n\n**Option(1): +, ÷, ×, +**\n\nGiven expression is 78 * 26 * 4 * 13 * 28 = 58\n\nReplacing * with mathematical signs, we get:\n\n78 + 26 ÷ 4 × 13 + 28 = 58 \n\nL.H.S = 78 + 26 ÷ 4 × 13 + 28\n\n= 78 + __**26 ÷ 4**__ × 13 + 28\n\n= 78 +__** 6.5 × 13**__ + 28\n\n= __**78 + 84.5 + 28**__\n\n**= 190.5 ≠ 58**\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option (2): ÷, +, ×, -**\n\nGiven expression is 78 * 26 * 4 * 13 * 28 = 58\n\nReplacing * with mathematical signs, we get:\n\n78 ÷ 26 + 4 × 13 - 28 = 58 \n\nL.H.S = 78 ÷ 26 + 4 × 13 - 28 \n\n= __**78 ÷ 26**__ + 4 × 13 - 28 \n\n= 3 + __**4 × 13**__ - 28\n\n= __**3 + 52**__ - 28\n\n= __**55 - 28**__\n\n⇒ **27 ****≠** **58**\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption (3): -, ÷, +, × \n\nGiven expression is 78 * 26 * 4 * 13 * 28 = 58\n\nReplacing * with mathematical signs, we get:\n\n78 - 26 ÷ 4 + 13 × 28 = 58 \n\nL.H.S = 78 - 26 ÷ 4__** **__+ 13 × 28 \n\n= 78 - __**26 ÷ 4**__ + 13 × 28 \n\n= 78 - 6.5 +__** 13 × 28**__\n\n= __**78**__ - 6.5 +__** 364**__\n\n= __**442 - 6.5**__\n\n= **435.5 **≠ 58\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption (4): + , × , ÷, - \n\nGiven expression is 78 * 26 * 4 * 13 * 28 = 58\n\nReplacing * with mathematical signs, we get:\n\n78 + 26 × 4 ÷ 13 - 28 = 58 \n\nL.H.S = 78 + 26 × 4 ÷ 13 - 28\n\n⇒ 78 + __**26 × 4** ÷ 1____**3**__ - 28\n\n⇒ __**78 + 8**__ - 28\n\n⇒ __**86 - 28**__\n\n**58 = 58 **\n\n**LHS = RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"option 4\"**.",
